OL,3,GNEWSAMusic venue bids to revive city's
OL,4,Agigging glory days
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere was a time when Wakefield buzzed
OL,7,Fwith live music as crowds packed into
OL,8,Fpubs to watch bands such as The Cribs
OL,9,Fand The Kooks during their rise to
OL,10,Ffame. Although much of the grassroots
OL,11,Fscene has since faded, a new live music
OL,12,Fvenue hopes to bring back the glory
OL,13,Fdays for emerging talent.
OL,15,FThe Backroom, which opened this week
OL,16,Finside the city's Hop and Cobble pub,
OL,17,Faims to give young musicians a taste of
OL,18,Fperforming to an audience in a
OL,19,Fpurpose-built space.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
