OL,3,GNEWSAMusic venue bids to revive city's
OL,4,Agigging glory days
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor musician Adam Schofield, a singer
OL,7,Fin a band during Wakefield's music
OL,8,Fscene heyday, the inspiration came from
OL,9,Fa lack of opportunities for young bands
OL,10,Fto hone their craft.
OL,12,FIt struck a chord with Hop owner Jamie
OL,13,FLawson and, over a pint, the pair came
OL,14,Fup with the idea for the Backroom.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
